<h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto">Chrome 145 adds support for the <code class="notranslate">presentationTime</code> and <code class="notranslate">paintTime</code> to relevant performance entries (<code class="notranslate">PerformancePaintTiming</code>, <code class="notranslate">LongestContentfulPaint</code>, <code class="notranslate">PerformanceElementTiming</code>, and <code class="notranslate">PerformanceLongAnimationFrameTiming</code>). See <a href="https://chromestatus.com/feature/5162859838046208" rel="nofollow">https://chromestatus.com/feature/5162859838046208</a>.</p>
<p dir="auto">This PR documents these properties on each separate interface and adds a few other appropriate mentions besides. Let me know if you feel other mentions or coverage are needed.</p>

